月25日收盘6.56元，年内跌19.8%，接近近12年最低点6.209元（2024年2月5日）。 国资委2024年12月印发《关于改进和加强中央企业控股上市公司市值管理工作的若干意见》，将市值管理纳入央企负责人经营业绩考核，要求解决长期破净问题，强化分红和回购。 关于高管任职渠道：董事长张威和总经理卓普周均通过中国中铁体系内组织选拔晋升，并非市场化公开招聘。央企董事长、总经理等核心高管通常由上级党组织或国资委任命，坚持党管干部原则，人事任免主要采取组织选拔方式，公开招聘更多用于中层及以下岗位。 风险提示：以上分析基于公开资讯与历史数据，仅供参考，不构成投资建议。市场有风险，投资需谨慎，建议结合自身风险承受能力，理性决策。 （以上内容由AI生成）","at":"2026-11-26 10:38:50","replyTo":null}]},{"id":"1801741597","objectId":"stock600528","title":"中铁工业：基建装备龙头，价值重估可期（888字）中铁工业是国内A股独有的轨道交通","url":"https://guba.eastmoney.com/news,600528,1801741597.html","date":"2026-11-26","publishedAt":"2026-11-26 10:33:01","source":"东方财富股吧","readCount":120,"commentCount":0,"content":"","coverage":{"comments":"complete","fetchedComments":0,"body":"missing","reportedComments":0,"commentSource":"embedded-page","bodySource":"html-body","contentTruncated":false},"boardVerified":true,"nativeBoard":"600528","comments":[]},{"id":"1801738927","objectId":"stock600528","title":"守一月有惊喜","url":"https://guba.eastmoney.com/news,600528,1801738927.html","date":"2026-11-26","publishedAt":"2026-11-26 10:31:21","source":"东方财富股吧","readCount":18,"commentCount":0,"content":"","coverage":{"comments":"complete","fetchedComments":0,"body":"missing","reportedComments":0,"commentSource":"embedded-page","bodySource":"html-body","contentTruncated":false},"boardVerified":true,"nativeBoard":"600528","comments":[]},{"id":"1801711300","objectId":"stock600528","title":"稳稳的，慢慢来","url":"https://guba.eastmoney.com/news,600528,1801711300.html","date":"2026-11-26","publishedAt":"2026-11-26 10:16:06","source":"东方财富股吧","readCount":26,"commentCount":1,"content":"","coverage":{"comments":"complete","fetchedComments":1,"body":"missing","reportedComments":1,"commentSource":"public-web-and-child-pagination","bodySource":"html-body","contentTruncated":false},"boardVerified":true,"nativeBoard":"600528","comments":[{"id":"9983718016","text":"你怕是有点啥吧？","at":"2026-11-26 10:23:20","replyTo":null}]},{"id":"1801551190","objectId":"stock600528","title":"中铁工业：融资净偿还